Object.assign(window.AIDECIS_TRANSLATIONS.es || (window.AIDECIS_TRANSLATIONS.es={}), {"Benefits": "Beneficios", "Industries": "Sectores", "Menu": "Menú", "Benefits and investment calculator": "Calculadora de beneficios e inversión", "Different industries. The same need for accountable decisions.": "Distintos sectores. La misma necesidad de decisiones responsables.", "Choose your industry": "Elige tu sector", "Explore the industry": "Explorar el sector", "Decisions Aidecis helps control": "Decisiones que Aidecis ayuda a controlar", "One decision in practice": "Una decisión en la práctica", "Operating context": "Contexto operativo", "What could this mean for your network?": "¿Qué podría significar para tu red?", "Explore potential benefits and your investment.": "Explora los beneficios potenciales y tu inversión.", "Calculate benefits and investment": "Calcular beneficios e inversión", "The world keeps moving.": "El mundo sigue en movimiento.", "Pause film": "Pausar vídeo", "Play film": "Reproducir vídeo", "Supply-chain film: fields, production, transport and ports.": "Vídeo de cadena de suministro: campos, producción, transporte y puertos.", "Proposal for review · not the live website": "Propuesta para revisión · no es el sitio publicado", "The estimate updates as you change your network.": "La estimación se actualiza al cambiar tu red.", "Automotive": "Automoción", "Automotive supply chains connect many supplier tiers with just-in-time and just-in-sequence production. EVs add battery materials, source requirements and battery regulation. One late part or unapproved substitution can affect an entire production schedule.": "Las cadenas de automoción conectan múltiples niveles de proveedores con producción justo a tiempo y en secuencia. Los vehículos eléctricos añaden materiales de baterías, requisitos de origen y regulación. Una pieza retrasada o una sustitución no aprobada puede afectar a todo el programa de producción.", "Pharma and biotech": "Farmacéutica y biotecnología", "GMP requirements, temperature-sensitive shipments and serialisation create a chain where evidence matters at every hand-off. International dependence on active ingredients adds exposure. A deviation may require a batch hold, a quality review or a recall.": "Los requisitos GMP, los envíos sensibles a la temperatura y la serialización exigen pruebas en cada transferencia. La dependencia internacional de principios activos añade exposición. Una desviación puede requerir bloquear un lote, una revisión de calidad o una retirada.", "Food and beverage": "Alimentación y bebidas", "Perishable and seasonal materials meet volatile commodity prices, food-safety requirements and retailer commitments. A delivery change can affect shelf life, production, waste and service at the same time. Teams need to see the whole trade-off before committing.": "Los materiales perecederos y estacionales se combinan con precios volátiles, requisitos de seguridad alimentaria y compromisos con distribuidores. Un cambio de entrega puede afectar a la vida útil, la producción, el desperdicio y el servicio a la vez.", "Contract logistics": "Logística contractual", "3PL and e-commerce fulfilment operators coordinate multiple client networks, sites and service agreements. Rerouting, returns and customs exceptions move quickly. Each decision needs the right client rules, spending authority and accountable owner.": "Los operadores 3PL y de e-commerce coordinan redes de varios clientes, centros y acuerdos de servicio. Los cambios de ruta, devoluciones y excepciones aduaneras requieren las reglas del cliente, la autoridad de gasto y el responsable adecuados.", "Aerospace and defense": "Aeroespacial y defensa", "Long lead times, specialised suppliers and part traceability make aerospace and defense supply chains unforgiving. Production ramp-up and maintenance add pressure to scarce components. Changes must respect certification requirements, approved sources and applicable export restrictions.": "Los plazos largos, proveedores especializados y trazabilidad de piezas hacen exigentes estas cadenas. El aumento de producción y el mantenimiento presionan los componentes escasos. Los cambios deben respetar la certificación, fuentes aprobadas y controles de exportación aplicables.", "Semiconductors and electronics": "Semiconductores y electrónica", "Semiconductor and electronics production spans many process steps, countries and specialised suppliers. Concentrated manufacturing and equipment capacity can turn a local disruption into a network-wide shortage. Allocation and alternative sourcing need an explicit trade-off.": "La producción de semiconductores y electrónica abarca numerosos pasos, países y proveedores especializados. La concentración de capacidad y equipos puede convertir una interrupción local en escasez global. La asignación y las alternativas de suministro requieren decisiones explícitas.", "Medical devices": "Productos sanitarios", "Medical-device supply chains combine specialised suppliers, identification and traceability requirements, and validated production or sterilisation steps. A component change can affect safety, documentation and supply continuity. Approval needs to stay connected to the evidence.": "Estas cadenas combinan proveedores especializados, identificación y trazabilidad, y procesos validados de producción o esterilización. Un cambio de componente puede afectar a la seguridad, documentación y continuidad del suministro. La aprobación debe permanecer vinculada a las pruebas.", "Chemicals and specialty chemicals": "Química y química especializada", "Chemical supply chains connect feedstock availability, continuous processes and bulk or tank logistics. Hazardous materials and compatibility constraints make a quick workaround consequential. Teams need cost, safety evidence and operating authority in the same decision.": "Las cadenas químicas conectan materias primas, procesos continuos y logística a granel o en cisternas. Los materiales peligrosos y restricciones de compatibilidad hacen importantes las soluciones urgentes. Coste, seguridad y autoridad deben formar parte de la misma decisión.", "Machinery and industrial equipment": "Maquinaria y equipos industriales", "High-mix, low-volume and engineer-to-order production brings many unique parts, engineering changes and project commitments. Long service lives add spare-parts dependencies. Local choices need to remain connected to cost, specification and delivery consequences.": "La producción de alta variedad, bajo volumen y bajo pedido combina piezas únicas, cambios de ingeniería y compromisos de proyecto. Las largas vidas útiles añaden dependencia de repuestos. Las decisiones locales deben conectarse con coste, especificaciones y entrega.", "Fashion, textiles and retail": "Moda, textiles y retail", "Short collection cycles, large product ranges and fragmented supplier networks make timing and visibility difficult. A late shipment can force markdowns or costly air freight. Sourcing transparency and due-diligence obligations add evidence requirements that vary by market and company.": "Los ciclos cortos, amplios surtidos y redes fragmentadas dificultan el control de plazos. Un retraso puede provocar rebajas o transporte aéreo costoso. La transparencia y diligencia debida añaden requisitos de pruebas que varían según mercado y empresa."});
Object.assign(window.AIDECIS_TRANSLATIONS.nl || (window.AIDECIS_TRANSLATIONS.nl={}), {"Benefits": "Voordelen", "Industries": "Sectoren", "Menu": "Menu", "Benefits and investment calculator": "Calculator voor voordelen en investering", "Different industries. The same need for accountable decisions.": "Verschillende sectoren. Dezelfde behoefte aan verantwoorde beslissingen.", "Choose your industry": "Kies je sector", "Explore the industry": "Bekijk de sector", "Decisions Aidecis helps control": "Beslissingen die Aidecis helpt beheersen", "One decision in practice": "Een beslissing in de praktijk", "Operating context": "Operationele context", "What could this mean for your network?": "Wat kan dit voor joje netwerk betekenen?", "Explore potential benefits and your investment.": "Bekijk de mogelijke voordelen en jouw investering.", "Calculate benefits and investment": "Bereken voordelen en investering", "The world keeps moving.": "De wereld blijft in beweging.", "Pause film": "Film pauzeren", "Play film": "Film afspelen", "Supply-chain film: fields, production, transport and ports.": "Supplychainfilm: akkers, productie, transport en havens.", "Proposal for review · not the live website": "Voorstel ter beoordeling · niet de live website", "The estimate updates as you change your network.": "De raming verandert mee met joje netwerk.", "Automotive": "Automotive", "Automotive supply chains connect many supplier tiers with just-in-time and just-in-sequence production. EVs add battery materials, source requirements and battery regulation. One late part or unapproved substitution can affect an entire production schedule.": "Autoketens verbinden meerdere leveranciersniveaus met just-in-time- en just-in-sequenceproductie. Elektrische voertuigen voegen batterijmaterialen, herkomsteisen en batterijregelgeving toe. Eén vertraagd onderdeel of ongeoorloofde vervanging kan de hele productieplanning raken.", "Pharma and biotech": "Farmacie en biotech", "GMP requirements, temperature-sensitive shipments and serialisation create a chain where evidence matters at every hand-off. International dependence on active ingredients adds exposure. A deviation may require a batch hold, a quality review or a recall.": "GMP-eisen, temperatuurgevoelige zendingen en serialisatie vragen bij elke overdracht om bewijs. Internationale afhankelijkheid van werkzame stoffen vergroot de kwetsbaarheid. Een afwijking kan leiden tot een geblokkeerde batch, kwaliteitsonderzoek of terugroepactie.", "Food and beverage": "Voeding en dranken", "Perishable and seasonal materials meet volatile commodity prices, food-safety requirements and retailer commitments. A delivery change can affect shelf life, production, waste and service at the same time. Teams need to see the whole trade-off before committing.": "Bederfelijke en seizoensgebonden grondstoffen komen samen met volatiele prijzen, voedselveiligheidseisen en afspraken met retailers. Een gewijzigde levering kan tegelijk de houdbaarheid, productie, verspilling en service raken.", "Contract logistics": "Contractlogistiek", "3PL and e-commerce fulfilment operators coordinate multiple client networks, sites and service agreements. Rerouting, returns and customs exceptions move quickly. Each decision needs the right client rules, spending authority and accountable owner.": "3PL- en e-commercebedrijven coördineren meerdere klantnetwerken, locaties en serviceafspraken. Omleidingen, retouren en douane-uitzonderingen vragen om de juiste klantregels, bestedingsbevoegdheid en verantwoordelijke eigenaar.", "Aerospace and defense": "Luchtvaart en defensie", "Long lead times, specialised suppliers and part traceability make aerospace and defense supply chains unforgiving. Production ramp-up and maintenance add pressure to scarce components. Changes must respect certification requirements, approved sources and applicable export restrictions.": "Lange levertijden, gespecialiseerde leveranciers en traceerbaarheid van onderdelen maken deze ketens veeleisend. Productieopschaling en onderhoud vergroten de druk op schaarse onderdelen. Wijzigingen moeten passen binnen certificering, goedgekeurde bronnen en toepasselijke exportregels.", "Semiconductors and electronics": "Halfgeleiders en elektronica", "Semiconductor and electronics production spans many process steps, countries and specialised suppliers. Concentrated manufacturing and equipment capacity can turn a local disruption into a network-wide shortage. Allocation and alternative sourcing need an explicit trade-off.": "Productie van halfgeleiders en elektronica omvat veel processtappen, landen en gespecialiseerde leveranciers. Geconcentreerde productie- en equipmentcapaciteit kan een lokale verstoring tot een breed tekort maken. Allocatie en alternatieve inkoop vragen om expliciete afwegingen.", "Medical devices": "Medische hulpmiddelen", "Medical-device supply chains combine specialised suppliers, identification and traceability requirements, and validated production or sterilisation steps. A component change can affect safety, documentation and supply continuity. Approval needs to stay connected to the evidence.": "Deze ketens combineren gespecialiseerde leveranciers, identificatie en traceerbaarheid met gevalideerde productie- of sterilisatiestappen. Een gewijzigd onderdeel kan veiligheid, documentatie en leveringscontinuïteit raken. Goedkeuring moet verbonden blijven met het bewijs.", "Chemicals and specialty chemicals": "Chemie en specialty chemicals", "Chemical supply chains connect feedstock availability, continuous processes and bulk or tank logistics. Hazardous materials and compatibility constraints make a quick workaround consequential. Teams need cost, safety evidence and operating authority in the same decision.": "Chemische ketens verbinden grondstofbeschikbaarheid, continue processen en bulk- of tanklogistiek. Gevaarlijke stoffen en compatibiliteitseisen maken snelle oplossingen ingrijpend. Kosten, veiligheidsbewijs en bevoegdheid horen bij dezelfde beslissing.", "Machinery and industrial equipment": "Machines en industriële apparatuur", "High-mix, low-volume and engineer-to-order production brings many unique parts, engineering changes and project commitments. Long service lives add spare-parts dependencies. Local choices need to remain connected to cost, specification and delivery consequences.": "High-mix-, low-volume- en engineer-to-orderproductie brengt unieke onderdelen, engineeringwijzigingen en projectafspraken samen. Lange levensduur voegt afhankelijkheid van reserveonderdelen toe. Lokale keuzes moeten verbonden blijven met kosten, specificaties en leveringsgevolgen.", "Fashion, textiles and retail": "Mode, textiel en retail", "Short collection cycles, large product ranges and fragmented supplier networks make timing and visibility difficult. A late shipment can force markdowns or costly air freight. Sourcing transparency and due-diligence obligations add evidence requirements that vary by market and company.": "Korte collectiecycli, grote assortimenten en versnipperde leveranciersnetwerken maken planning en inzicht lastig. Vertraging kan tot afprijzingen of dure luchtvracht leiden. Transparantie en zorgvuldigheid voegen bewijseisen toe die per markt en bedrijf verschillen."});
